---
description: Keep Cursor prompts small with AmniTex
alwaysApply: true
---

Do not reread a whole file or paste a whole tool log. Use atex_where to find the file, then atex_recall with query or lines. A large or repeated read is replaced by a short excerpt before it reaches the model. If those tools are not in this session, use the shell: atex where, atex recall, atex search, and atex remember. The session card is the durable state.
